<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Natwest said it lowered its recommendation on Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold Inc to hold from buy and cut the third quarter earnings estimate to $0.40 per share from $0.56.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/4 to 31-1/2 in midday New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
